stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Unsaved
  Unsaved --> Draft: CreateDraft
  Unsaved --> Saved: CreateSaved
  Unsaved --> Archived: CreateArchived
  Draft --> Saved: Save
  Saved --> Rerun: Run
  Stale --> Rerun: Run
  Rerun --> Saved: RunSucceeds
  Rerun --> Stale: RunFailsWithOldSnapshot
  Rerun --> Saved: RunFailsWithFreshSnapshot
  Saved --> Stale: EditCriteria
  Saved --> Stale: Age24Hours
  Draft --> Archived: Archive
  Saved --> Archived: Archive
  Stale --> Archived: Archive
  Archived --> Saved: Restore
  Saved --> Saved: Reopen
  Stale --> Stale: Reopen
  %% Guards are exercised by the registered-verb lifecycle test.
  %% A stale revision cannot overwrite a newer search.
  %% A failed run preserves the prior result snapshot and freshness state.
